---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import BackButton from "@/components/BackButton.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy | ReviByte Opinion";
const description = "Transparent privacy practices at ReviByte Opinion – we collect almost nothing, never sell your data, and put your trust first.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div style="max-width:56rem; margin: 1rem auto; padding: 0 1rem;">
    <BackButton />
  </div>
  <article class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 dark:prose-invert">
    <header class="text-center">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy – ReviByte Opinion</h1>
      <p class="lead text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        We value your privacy. This document explains what data we collect (very little), why, and how it's used.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        Last updated: June 7, 2026
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2">
        Questions? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:revibyte20@gmail.com" class="font-semibold text-blue-600 hover:underline">
          revibyte20@gmail.com
        </a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="my-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 p-8 dark:bg-blue-950/30">
      <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-center text-2xl font-bold">
        Quick Summary
      </h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lg">
        <li>• We do <strong>not sell</strong> your personal information.</li>
        <li>• We use minimal cookies (only for basic functionality and ads).</li>
        <li>• Some data is collected automatically (IP, device info, pages visited).</li>
        <li>• Push notifications are only sent if you click "Allow" — you can unsubscribe anytime.</li>
        <li>• You can request deletion or opt out of personalized ads anytime.</li>
        <li>• This site complies with GDPR, CCPA, COPPA, and advertising policies.</li>
        <li>• Some links are affiliate links — we may earn a small commission at no cost to you.</li>
        <li>• Heliara AI messages are processed by Groq — we do not store your chat history.</li>
        <li>• ReviByte Save sends URLs to third-party APIs to fetch media — we do not store those URLs.</li>
        <li>• Anonymous comments are stored via Supabase — no account or personal identity required.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">1. What Information Do We Collect?</h2>
      <p><strong>We collect only the minimum information needed to run the site.</strong></p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">Automatically Collected Data</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2">
        <li>IP address (may be anonymized depending on your region)</li>
        <li>Device type, operating system, and browser</li>
        <li>Pages viewed, time spent, and referral source</li>
        <li>Advertising identifiers (Google AdSense cookies, if ads are active)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">Comments</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2">
        <li>ReviByte has an anonymous comment system. When you leave a comment, we collect your chosen display name and comment text only.</li>
        <li>No account, email address, or personal identity is required to comment.</li>
        <li>Comments are stored via Supabase. Your display name and comment text are visible publicly on the post.</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to remove comments that violate our Terms and Conditions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">Push Notifications (Optional)</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2">
        <li>If you click "Allow" on our push notification prompt, OneSignal stores your browser token to send you alerts when new posts are published.</li>
        <li>No personal identity (name, email) is collected for this.</li>
        <li>You can unsubscribe from notifications at any time through your browser settings.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">Heliara AI</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2">
        <li>When you use Heliara AI, your messages are sent to <strong>Groq's API</strong> for processing. Groq may log requests per their own privacy policy.</li>
        <li>ReviByte does <strong>not store</strong> your Heliara AI conversation history on any server.</li>
        <li>Chat history exists only in your browser session memory and is cleared when you close or refresh the page.</li>
        <li>Do not share sensitive personal information (passwords, financial details, ID numbers) with Heliara AI.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">ReviByte Save (Media Downloader)</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2">
        <li>ReviByte Save sends URLs you submit to RapidAPI's infrastructure to fetch media information. ReviByte does not store submitted URLs or downloaded media.</li>
        <li>ReviByte Save is intended for personal use only. Users are responsible for ensuring they have rights to download any content.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">If You Contact Us</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2">
        <li>Name and email address you provide</li>
        <li>Your message content</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-4">We do <strong>not collect</strong> passwords, payment details, or sensitive personal data.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate and maintain the website</li>
        <li>To understand visitor engagement and improve content</li>
        <li>To display relevant advertisements (via Google AdSense)</li>
        <li>To send push notifications about new posts (only if you opted in)</li>
        <li>To store and display anonymous comments on posts</li>
        <li>To process Heliara AI chat messages via Groq's API</li>
        <li>To fetch media information via third-party APIs for ReviByte Save</li>
        <li>To reply to your emails or support requests</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">3. Cookies & Advertising</h2>
      <p>This site may use cookies from:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google Analytics (for understanding traffic patterns)</li>
        <li>Google AdSense / Advertising partners (for serving relevant ads)</li>
        <li>OneSignal (for push notification delivery)</li>
        <li>Cloudflare (for security, performance, and DDoS protection)</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-4">These help show relevant ads, protect the site, and improve user experience.</p>

      <p class="mt-6">
        <strong>Manage or disable personalized ads:</strong><br/>
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline mr-4">
          Google Ad Preferences
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.youradchoices.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">
          AdChoices Opt-Out
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">4. Affiliate Links Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        ReviByte participates in the <strong>Amazon Associates Program</strong>, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by linking to Amazon.com. Some posts and banners on this site contain affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission — at <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>. This never influences our editorial opinions or recommendations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>ReviByte uses the following third-party services:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Vercel</strong> — Hosting and deployment
          (<a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> — DNS, security, DDoS protection, and performance optimization. Cloudflare may process visitor IP addresses and request data to protect the site.
          (<a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> — Anonymous visitor statistics
          (<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google AdSense</strong> — Displaying advertisements and using cookies for personalized ads
          (<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>OneSignal</strong> — Push notification delivery (only if you opted in)
          (<a href="https://onesignal.com/privacy_policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Amazon Associates</strong> — Affiliate program. Some links on this site are affiliate links. We earn a small commission on qualifying purchases at no extra cost to you.
          (<a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=468496" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">learn more</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Supabase</strong> — Anonymous comment storage. Display names and comment text are stored. No personal identity or account is required.
          (<a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Groq</strong> — AI inference for Heliara AI. Your chat messages are processed by Groq's servers. ReviByte does not store chat data.
          (<a href="https://groq.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>RapidAPI</strong> — API gateway used by ReviByte Save to process media download requests. URLs you submit are routed through RapidAPI's infrastructure. ReviByte does not store submitted URLs or downloaded media.
          (<a href="https://rapidapi.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy policy</a>)
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Microsoft Store / PWABuilder</strong> — ReviByte is listed as a Progressive Web App on the Microsoft Store.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location (EU, UK, California, etc.), you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your personal data</li>
        <li>Request corrections or deletion</li>
        <li>Receive a copy of your data (portability)</li>
        <li>Opt out of personalized advertising</li>
        <li>Request removal of a comment you posted</li>
        <li>Unsubscribe from push notifications via your browser settings</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Just email
        <a href="mailto:revibyte20@gmail.com?subject=Privacy Request" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">
          revibyte20@gmail.com
        </a> — I handle all requests personally within 48 hours.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>ReviByte is not intended for users under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children. Gaming content on this site (COD Mobile, eFootball, PUBG Mobile, Mobile Legends Bang Bang) is intended for general audiences and does not target minors. Heliara AI and ReviByte Save are also not intended for users under 13.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">8. Data Retention</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Analytics data: up to 26 months</li>
        <li>Push notification tokens: retained until you unsubscribe</li>
        <li>Comments: retained indefinitely unless you request deletion</li>
        <li>Emails/messages: kept only as long as needed</li>
        <li>Ad data: controlled by Google</li>
        <li>Heliara AI chat messages: not stored by ReviByte — session only</li>
        <li>ReviByte Save submitted URLs: not stored by ReviByte</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">9. Security</h2>
      <p>We use HTTPS encryption, Cloudflare security headers and DDoS protection, and rely on secure third-party platforms to protect any stored data. No sensitive personal data is stored on ReviByte's servers. Heliara AI and ReviByte Save API endpoints are server-side only — API keys are never exposed to the browser.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We'll update this page if anything changes. The "Last updated" date at the top will always reflect the latest version.</p>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-16 text-center text-lg italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Thank you for trusting <strong>ReviByte Opinion</strong> with your time — and your privacy.<br /><br />
      — <strong>Oke "iSamuel"</strong>, Founder
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  article.prose p,
  article.prose li,
  article.prose dd,
  article.prose dt,
  article.prose h1,
  article.prose h2,
  article.prose h3,
  article.prose blockquote,
  article.prose strong {
    color: #1a1a1a !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }

  article.prose a {
    color: #006cac !important;
  }

  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose p,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose li,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose dd,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose dt,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose h1,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose h2,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose h3,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose blockquote,
  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose strong {
    color: #eaedf3 !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }

  html[data-theme="dark"] article.prose a {
    color: #ff6b01 !important;
  }
</style>
